	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et pacem a domino per Iesum, servatorem nostrum.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Venerande frater, accepi proximis, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>quas ad me 25. semptembris<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Zu dieser Schreibform s. <bibl source="b616">Stotz</bibl> III 292, Nr. 251.1.</note> scripsisti, litteris<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Nicht erhalten.</note> animum tuum erga me et totam <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>meam familiam propensissimum; pro quo gratias ago deo meo, qui me in <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>huiusmodi anxietatibus nusquam dereliquit, deinde tibi, non quas debeo, sed <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>quas pro hac vice possum, gratias habeo, qui michi, benevolenti deo pro <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>tibi data gratia, obedientiam<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" ana="lex" n="3">Zuwendung.</note> tantam praestitisti, ut illi<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Gemeint ist Gott.</note>, qui tuo michi bene<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>voluit ministerio, obsequeris.<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Offensichtlich hatte <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> seine handschriftlich gebliebene Abhandlung "Contra scandala ex bello infeliciter gesto oborta Apologia" nicht nur an <persName ref="p8055">Ambrosius Blarer</persName>, <persName ref="p8354">Georg Frölich</persName> und <persName ref="p8049">Joachim Vadian</persName>, sondern auch an <persName ref="p8440">Schuler</persName> gesandt; s. <ref target="file13072">Nr. 3023</ref>, <ptr target="qvfn17291-2" type="qv"/>. Diese Vermutung wird unten in Z. <ptr target="qvzl17295-1" type="qv"/> erhärtet.<ptr target="zfnfn17295-1" type="zfn"/></note></s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Dominus hic <pb type="edition" next="512"/> <placeName ref="l320">Memminge</placeName> exaudivit preces <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>adflictę ecclesię suę.<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Indem die <placeName ref="l320">Memminger</placeName> die von ihnen befürchtete (s. dazu <ref target="file13050">Nr. 3001</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17268-7" type="qv"/>) Einquartierung von kaiserlichen Truppen in ihrer Stadt durch eine Geldzahlung abwenden konnten; s. <ref target="file13050">Nr. 3001</ref>, <ptr target="qvfn17268-1" type="qv"/>; <ref target="file13069">Nr. 3020</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17288-4" type="qv"/>.</note></s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Apud te tuo ministerio supra modum me consolatus <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>est.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Quod uxorem<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="7">[...] <persName ref="p19837">Schuler, geb. Lübegger</persName>.</note> et familiam<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="8">Zu <persName ref="p8440">Schulers</persName> Kindern s. <bibl source="b172">Culmann, Schuler</bibl> 76; <bibl source="b12">HBBW X</bibl> 32, Anm. 9f; XIII 66, Anm. 19; XV 222, Anm. 48f; 480,33-35.</note> attinet meam, omnia per deum bene habent.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Ecclesia michi commissa in oratione assidua est expectans auxilium domini.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Pontificii val<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>de invident nobis hanc <ptr target="fna" type="footnote" n="a"/>pendulam (quod hostium opinionem spectat)<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>Klammern ergänzt.</hi></note><note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>Am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> foelicitatem, qua per dominum in tantis rerum <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>turbis fruimur.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Unde est, quod omnes conatus huc conferant, ut nobis <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>missaticam saltem nundinationem obtrudant.<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Siehe schon <ref target="file13050">Nr. 3001</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17268-6" type="qv"/>. <ptr target="qvzl17268-8" type="qv"/>.</note></s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Nos illam totis viribus depreca<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>mur.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">De reliquis ex presentium latore<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Unbekannt.</note> accipies meo ad illum relatu.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Uxor mea precatur tibi tuęque familię omnem in domino foelicitatem <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>gratiasque maximas agit tue in nos benefolentię.<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">= benevolentiae.</note></s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Recompensura, si quando <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>fieri potest, hanc tuam in nos animi promptitudinem.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutat te <persName ref="p1257">Funckius</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>consul<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><persName ref="p1257">Balthasar Funk</persName>, der Bürgermeister von <placeName ref="l320">Memmingen</placeName>.</note>, <persName ref="p3994">Huldrichus</persName><note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13"><persName ref="p3994">Ulrich Wolfhart</persName>.</note> medicus, doctor et mecenas noster, et fratrum <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>symmistarum totus conventus, qui in officio ecclesię tuis lucubrationibus<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Siehe dazu oben <ptr target="qvfn17295-1" type="qv"/>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>non parum gaudent se esse adiutos.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Behut dich und die deynen <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>der liebe gott, früntlicher, hertzlieber pruͦder.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de">Laß dir mitt dißem <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>meynem schreyben meyne treheren<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">Tränen; s. <bibl source="b260">Grimm</bibl> XXI 1170 s.v. träher.</note> zuͦ hertzen gohn und bitt <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>für die kirchen zu <placeName ref="l320">Memmingen</placeName> und mich, deinen lieben pruͦder, etc.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Datum <placeName ref="l320">Memmingę</placeName>, prima octobris anno 1547.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Tuus <persName ref="p8440">Gervasius</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>amicus ille inquam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo meo et veteri amico et <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>domino <persName ref="p495">Heynricho Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tyguri<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>nę</placeName> ecclesię antistiti, etc.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>